stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> unconfigured
  unconfigured --> validating: ENV role + source + adapter
  validating --> error: missing token / invalid shape / unsupported format
  validating --> fetching: source=hf_hub (cache missing)
  validating --> warming: source=local or cached hf_hub
  validating --> remote_ready: source=hf_remote and provider task supported
  validating --> mock_ready: source=mock
  fetching --> warming: revision pinned / downloaded & cached
  fetching --> error: network failure / license / disk quota
  warming --> ready: validated IO + warmup
  warming --> error: OOM / unsupported GPU / invalid tensor
  ready --> draining: reload model / shutdown
  draining --> unconfigured: release resources
  error --> validating: fix ENV / retry
  ready --> error: runtime exception
